  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Steak Knife\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/1h-weapon-_Steak_Knife.png\" title=\"Steak Knife\"><img alt=\"Steak Knife\" border=\"0\" src=\"/images/recovered/1h-weapon-_Steak_Knife.png\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Damage Type:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Slashing\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Wielding:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">One-Handed\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Attack Speed:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Normal\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Client weapon speed:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">103\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Client damage coeff:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">0.80\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p><b>Steak Knife</b> is listed on the <a href=\"/wiki/Category/One-Handed-fighter\" title=\"Category:One-Handed-fighter\">One-Handed-fighter</a> weapon list. Stats on this page come from that list and the Dungeon Runners client files.</p>\n<p>The client also has material-tier versions of this weapon (Cardboard Steak Knife, Celestial Steak Knife, Diamond Steak Knife, Iron Steak Knife, Obsidian Steak Knife, Stone Steak Knife, Tin Steak Knife, Titanium Steak Knife, \u2026).</p>\n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
